<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The English original of every word Humsafar shows a driver.

  Nothing a driver reads lives in Kotlin. Humsafar speaks all nineteen languages
  the Saarthi platform supports, and each has a file beside this one
  (values-bn, values-b+doi, …) with exactly these keys and the same
  placeholders — LanguageCoverageTest holds every file to that.

  Grouped by the screen that uses them, in the order a driver meets them.
  Humsafar, VorldX and Saarthi are names and are never translated; "Saarthi"
  here is the platform and its voice assistant, not this app.
-->
